            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.4.2+REV.4.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ubuso 4:2-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa mulu wa lwelele ulwali pa mulu wa mitwe yafiko pali icintu icalemoneka nge cipuna cabufumu, icapangilwe ne libwe ilya safile, no waikelepo alemoneka ngo muntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.8.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek 8:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ine namwene icalemoneka ngo musana wakwe ukufika ku mutwe alebengeshima nge cela pakati ka mulilo, elyo ukutula mu musana ukushinta na ku makasa yakwe alebeka ngo mulilo. No lubuuto ulwabekesha lwalimushingulwike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ulubuuto ulwamushingulwike lwali ngo mukolamfula mu makumbi pa bushiku bwa mfula, efyo ubucindami ubwamushingulwike bwalemoneka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.28"
            ]
          }
        }
